{"id": "27046", "title": "野祭", "author": "蒋光慈", "category": "文学名著", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/27/27046.htm", "intro": "蒋光慈（1901-1931），现代著名作家。二十年代前期曾留学苏联，1924年回国后，积极倡导革命文学，致力于普罗小说的创作。他是中国无产阶级文学运动中活跃人物之一，是具有代表性的革命小说作家。其小说多以大革命为背景，反映工农群众和青年知识分子的革命斗争。他经常采用“革命加恋爱”的主题，表现历史转变关头革命青年的苦闷、悲愤和奋起抗争的精神世界。", "base": "files/article/html/27/27046", "chapters": [{"title": "书前", "file": "1833485.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一", "file": "1833488.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "1833493.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", "file": "1833511.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四", "file": "1833539.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五", "file": "1833545.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六", "file": "1833550.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七", "file": "1833553.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八", "file": "1833557.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九", "file": "1833568.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十", "file": "1833572.html", "available": false}]}